<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
B110-ZK-6112-TonalTextContrast.zul

	Purpose:
		Marble: small text that ZK-6112 drew on a tonal container or faded with opacity reaches 4.5:1 (WCAG 1.4.3).

	History:
		Thu Nov 05 2026, Created by hawk

Copyright (C) 2026 Potix Corporation. All Rights Reserved.
-->
<zk>
	<label multiline="true">
		Under Marble, every text below must reach 4.5:1 (an axe color-contrast scan of this page passes).
		axe skips one-character text, so the counter, the selected page and the other-month days have two digits.
		1. the Portallayout column counter "10"
		2. the Calendar's days from November (29, 30) and January, and its week numbers
		3. the selected Paging button "10" and the selected Navbar item
		4. the five Chip severities
	</label>
	<portallayout id="portal">
		<portalchildren id="todo" title="Todo" width="30%"/>
	</portallayout>
	<calendar id="cal" weekOfYear="true"/>
	<zscript><![CDATA[
		for (int i = 1; i <= 10; i++) {
			org.zkoss.zul.Panel panel = new org.zkoss.zul.Panel();
			panel.setTitle("Task " + i);
			todo.appendChild(panel);
		}
		cal.setValue(new java.text.SimpleDateFormat("yyyy-MM-dd").parse("2026-12-15"));
	]]></zscript>
	<paging id="paging" mold="os" totalSize="200" pageSize="10" activePage="9"/>
	<navbar id="navbar">
		<navitem label="Home" selected="true"/>
		<navitem label="Reports"/>
	</navbar>
	<div id="chips">
		<chip label="Info" severity="info"/>
		<chip label="Success" severity="success"/>
		<chip label="Warning" severity="warning"/>
		<chip label="Error" severity="error"/>
		<chip label="Neutral" severity="neutral"/>
	</div>
</zk>
